1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,294
Speaking, task three. Story number 11: An accident in a car park. What happened to Mrs Novotná yesterday? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,820
What happened to Mrs Novotná yesterday?

3
00:00:33,533 --> 00:00:36,456
Yesterday afternoon Mrs Novotná drove to the shops.

4
00:00:36,667 --> 00:00:38,689
She arrived at the supermarket car park.

5
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:42,463
Later, when she was reversing, she didn't see another car and hit it.

6
00:00:42,667 --> 00:00:44,467
The car had a broken light.

7
00:00:44,667 --> 00:00:47,790
Mrs Novotná was frightened, but nobody was hurt.

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,067
The owner of the other car was angry.

9
00:00:50,267 --> 00:00:52,454
Mrs Novotná called the police.

10
00:00:52,667 --> 00:00:55,667
The police arrived twenty minutes later and checked the documents.

11
00:00:55,867 --> 00:01:00,989
In the end Mrs Novotná and the other driver filled in an insurance form and went home.

12
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:10,579
Tell story 11 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
